  "+ / - (IDR)": {
   "id": "%40%7Dk%40",
   "name": "+ / - (IDR)",
   "description": "Net position = Revenue (IDR) \u2212 Cost (IDR). Revenue only populates on Incoming rows (linked Sale's Tacit Net Sales, or Price (IDR) if no Sale); Cost only populates on Outgoing rows (Sale's Club Net Sales for Partner Settlement, else Price (IDR)). Rebuilt 4 Jul 2026 to stop a linked Sale's revenue bleeding into unrelated cost rows. HR Salary cost-source removed 25 Sep 2026 \u2014 payroll is net-only cash basis. See Pre-Flight Artifacts.",
   "type": "formula",
   "formula": {
    "expression": "prop(\"Revenue (IDR)\") - prop(\"Cost (IDR)\")"
   }
