  "Cost (IDR)": {
   "id": "%5CT%3Cr",
   "name": "Cost (IDR)",
   "description": "Outgoing-only. Cost follows cash: the linked Sale's Club Net Sales (IDR) for Partner Settlement rows, else Price (IDR). Locked to 0 on Incoming rows. Loans excluded from the P&L (Type 8, 20 Jul 2026). HR Salary rollup branch REMOVED 25 Sep 2026 \u2014 payroll moved to a net-only cash basis, with the paid figure written into Price (IDR) and the gross/deduction detail held in TP: Human Resources. See Pre-Flight Artifact \u2014 Balance Sheet Payroll De-Coupling [25 Sep 2026].",
   "type": "formula",
   "formula": {
    "expression": "/* Loans are financing, not cost \u2014 any row tagged \"Loan\" (incl. repayments) is excluded from the P&L entirely (tracked separately in the Loans & Deferred app) */\nif(not empty(prop(\"Budget Category\")) and prop(\"Budget Category\").includes(\"Loan\"), 0,\n  if(prop(\"In/Out\") != \"Outgoing\", 0,\n    lets(\n      isSettlement, if(empty(prop(\"Budget Category\")), false, prop(\"Budget Category\").includes(\"Partner Settlement\")),\n      settlementCost, if(prop(\"Sales\").length() == 0, 0, prop(\"Sales\").map(current.prop(\"Club Net Sales (IDR)\")).sum()),\n      priceCost, if(empty(prop(\"Price (IDR)\")), 0, prop(\"Price (IDR)\")),\n      ifs(\n        isSettlement, settlementCost,\n        priceCost\n      )\n    )\n  )\n)"
   }
  },
